ADR-0001 | Per-service topology derivation — five-pass algorithm on the read side | accepted | Topology derived read-side per request via five-pass algorithm (bucket-by-env, explicit-first, correlation-fallback, merge, dangling); no stored topology rows | @docs/adr/ADR-0001-topology-derivation-five-pass.md
ADR-0002 | Modular monolith — single API container hosting two library surfaces | accepted | One ASP.NET host (backend/api/) composes write-api/ + read-api/ libraries + shared/; single Dockerfile; X-Api-Key on Write group only; future split is host+gateway-config change | @docs/adr/ADR-0002-modular-monolith-consolidation.md
ADR-0003 | Theme persistence in localStorage with FOIT-safe inline bootstrap | accepted | Theme preference in localStorage.dashboard.theme; FOIT-safe inline-script bootstrap before SPA boot sets <html data-theme>; single writer post-bootstrap (ThemeService in frontend/shared/) | @docs/adr/ADR-0003-theme-persistence-and-foit-safe-bootstrap.md
